### Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension, then click "Send Request".
@host = http://localhost:3000
# If ACCESS_TOKEN is set on the server, add:  Authorization: Bearer <token>

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Config (brains, models, languages)
GET {{host}}/api/config

### List conversations
GET {{host}}/api/conversations

### Chat (streams Server-Sent Events)
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "Explain closures in JavaScript in 3 sentences.", "brain": "claude", "language": "auto" }

### Search the knowledge base
GET {{host}}/api/knowledge/search?q=eva
